                    {
                        "form_id": "972e23ef-7d84-44f1-924e-fed8564c96e2",
                        "entry_id": "0c912c99-6bfc-38fe-8ac8-777c4ac125a6",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "фле́шках"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "80cd1c3c-b2c3-39b2-9c50-5781c4cc57dd",
                        "entry_id": "0c912c99-6bfc-38fe-8ac8-777c4ac125a6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. то же, что USB-флеш-накопитель; запоминающее устройство, использующее в качестве носителя флеш-память, и подключаемое к компьютеру или иному считывающему устройству по интерфейсу USB"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "602c900f-787c-4e86-880b-a5595c764c74",
                                "sense_id": "80cd1c3c-b2c3-39b2-9c50-5781c4cc57dd",
                                "text": "Снимки эти чудом сохранились на одной из флешек, их несколько всегда лежало в кармашке мягкого футляра, два года к ним никто не прикасался."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cab30f97-1639-4e5a-9ce8-ad882cc3aa99",
                        "source_entry_id": "0c912c99-6bfc-38fe-8ac8-777c4ac125a6",
                        "source_sense_id": "80cd1c3c-b2c3-39b2-9c50-5781c4cc57dd",
                        "target_lang_word": "memory stick",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "memory stick",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0068b009-4e92-3df5-8224-51a170d60f9d",
                                        "entry_id": "4a7c6daf-2a83-3dd6-9a57-0d1dcca925f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One of a series of memory devices manufactured by the Sony Corporation ranging in size from a USB drive down to a flash card."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7f70bc5c-d2f2-3baf-8ddc-e89ef03c5323",
                                        "entry_id": "4a7c6daf-2a83-3dd6-9a57-0d1dcca925f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A portable solid-state electronic flash memory data storage device equipped with a USB (or similarly specified) plug for direct connection to a corresponding port; a USB drive, thumb drive or pen drive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c49ca1d-3983-427c-8005-54db2f27e582",
                                                "sense_id": "7f70bc5c-d2f2-3baf-8ddc-e89ef03c5323",
                                                "text": "The first step to increasing your drive space is to add a new storage device. It can be a hard drive (IDE or SCSI), but also a USB or FireWire memory stick."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82f0171e-a610-4355-8c24-ac486eb3c606",
                                                "sense_id": "7f70bc5c-d2f2-3baf-8ddc-e89ef03c5323",
                                                "text": "You might be wondering at this point what dark secrets I had locked away on my phone and memory sticks and email."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78df0fd6-aec6-480c-a295-38ab09c1e189",
                                                "sense_id": "7f70bc5c-d2f2-3baf-8ddc-e89ef03c5323",
                                                "text": "To do this, you can run a script on a computer periodically to check for any attached USB disk drives or memory sticks."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "48c97708-e1bd-4664-bf98-e475bb9c0e90",
                        "source_entry_id": "0c912c99-6bfc-38fe-8ac8-777c4ac125a6",
                        "source_sense_id": "80cd1c3c-b2c3-39b2-9c50-5781c4cc57dd",
                        "target_lang_word": "thumb drive",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "thumb drive",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9e48ee87-39b1-3a50-8de4-bbc6857c76f6",
                                        "entry_id": "18f4b68a-bbec-3d6e-8bbc-5d1778044c3f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small electronic device used to store digital data, more portable and robust than a hard drive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3a9f788-aa39-4eb4-857c-fbc66749ec0b",
                                                "sense_id": "9e48ee87-39b1-3a50-8de4-bbc6857c76f6",
                                                "text": "The other gadget that Ethan needs to end the Entity is a \"poison pill\" – a thumb drive, basically – which has been invented by his pal Luther (Ving Rhames)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "47b38890-07e5-4493-81db-46c7cac374b8",
                        "source_entry_id": "0c912c99-6bfc-38fe-8ac8-777c4ac125a6",
                        "source_sense_id": "80cd1c3c-b2c3-39b2-9c50-5781c4cc57dd",
                        "target_lang_word": "pen drive",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pen drive",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "166854fb-54b3-3505-bfc6-4eb2f1b354ee",
                                        "entry_id": "8c33eb3a-eb37-348c-aee4-d1a56c13db8e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small electronic device used to store digital data, more portable and robust than a hard drive; a flash drive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5acf09d0-937b-4ecd-87fe-7912d3086ab1",
                                                "sense_id": "166854fb-54b3-3505-bfc6-4eb2f1b354ee",
                                                "text": "After Peter finished checking the operating system setup, he carefully unscrewed his pen drive and plugged the USB connection into the computer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d3f0765-8abd-459b-9869-c7c307c1b615",
                                                "sense_id": "166854fb-54b3-3505-bfc6-4eb2f1b354ee",
                                                "text": "So if you find yourself trapped in a pendrive/thumbdrive industry where everyone is basically making the same thing and copying patents whilst dishing out discounts, it's time to move on and separate yourself via a new identity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8f70f84-1629-4bf8-8329-33a3f2335389",
                                                "sense_id": "166854fb-54b3-3505-bfc6-4eb2f1b354ee",
                                                "text": "Pen drives have replaced the old floppy disks as the modern way to physically transport files from one computer to another. Yes, you can always email a file or burn it to a CD or DVD disc, but sometimes you just want to carry a copy of a file with you, and pen drives are so easy to use. You simply plug it into the USB port, and Windows treats it as just another storage location."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5049fbd9-6d74-49a7-bd21-11988ea1ab4a",
                                                "sense_id": "166854fb-54b3-3505-bfc6-4eb2f1b354ee",
                                                "text": "‘What the fuck is this?’ Sen examined and almost laughed upon recognizing it. ‘A pendrive! A fucking pendrive! That's what the planter calls a bomb? Is he fucking kidding me?’"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f92c26d-f3cf-4c02-bf70-306d5d49f1e9",
                                                "sense_id": "166854fb-54b3-3505-bfc6-4eb2f1b354ee",
                                                "text": "“If you don't mind, please give us the details in this pendrive,” I said, looking at his bald head."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "935cf937-c8c3-41ab-816a-f5b6cf512e60",
                        "source_entry_id": "0c912c99-6bfc-38fe-8ac8-777c4ac125a6",
